<title>UK: LEP makes information technology appointment.</title>
<headline>LEP makes information technology appointment.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>LEP International said it appointed Eric Veldboer as IT director Global Logistics and Tony Gudger as its European IT director.</p>
<p>Veldboer will be responsible for co-ordinating the implementation of LEP's global IT strategy, liaising with firms in Europe, the Asia-Pacific region and North America.</p>
<p>Gudger's will focus on the development of FAST400, LEP's IT system for the European market. - Reuters Air Cargo Service Tel+ 44 171 542 7706 Fax +5017 - www.racs.com</p>
